# oracle: pair ldd with a molecule template inserted by create_atoms (examples/PACKAGES/bocs/4_sites_LD_SG/in.ldd_create_data, cut down to 60 random molecule atoms in a 40^3 box, NVE for 10 steps). The table pair of the example is left out: with it, the per-atom forces differ from native by 5% at step 0 on this topology (pair table alone; the same table matches on the read_data topology of w112ldd_molecule_hybrid), a core residual. The example uses "loop geom" in velocity create; this case uses "loop all" (the engine velocity create with loop geom differs from native, see w112ld_basic_ldd).
# measured max error vs native (per atom, relative to max(1,|value|)): 9.0e-14 (atom 103 fz); thermo agrees at 1e-8.
# oracle-inputs: w112ldd_ABCD.mol w112ldd_bonded.lammps w112ldd_ABCD.ldd w112ldd_LD_table.11.noself.dat w112ldd_LD_table.22.noself.dat w112ldd_LD_table.33.noself.dat w112ldd_LD_table.44.noself.dat w112ldd_SG_table.1.1.noself.dat w112ldd_SG_table.2.2.noself.dat w112ldd_SG_table.3.3.noself.dat w112ldd_SG_table.4.4.noself.dat
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           real
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      full
timestep        0.5
bond_style harmonic
angle_style harmonic
dihedral_style harmonic
improper_style none
region my_box block 0 40 0 40 0 40
create_box 4 my_box bond/types 1 angle/types 1 dihedral/types 1 extra/bond/per/atom 12 extra/angle/per/atom 12 extra/dihedral/per/atom 8 extra/special/per/atom 30
mass  * 59.0448
molecule CHAIN w112ldd_ABCD.mol
create_atoms 0 random 60 885401 my_box mol CHAIN 454756
include w112ldd_bonded.lammps
pair_style      ldd
pair_coeff      * * w112ldd_ABCD.ldd A B C D
velocity        all create 300.0 22345 dist gaussian loop all
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0 every 1 check yes
thermo_style    custom step temp ke pe evdwl ebond eangle edihed etotal
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          5
fix             1  all      nve
run 10
